virtio-win, as LSW ships it
===========================

LSW installs into its Windows guest two files of virtio-win release
0.1.302-1 (https://github.com/virtio-win/kvm-guest-drivers-windows), taken
unmodified from that release's virtio-win-gt-x64.msi:

  - the viofs driver for Windows 11 amd64: viofs.inf, viofs.sys, viofs.cat
  - virtiofs.exe, the service that serves a virtio-fs device as a file
    system

under /usr/share/lsw/guest/virtiofs. virtio-win's Windows drivers and
virtiofs.exe are licensed under the BSD 3-Clause license below, which is
the virtio_win_license.txt that release carries.

